      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea that self-sacrifice through self-erasure is the ultimate act of compassion is a dangerous one. Your life has inherent value, and reducing it to a calculation of favors is not a fair assessment of your worth. Instead of viewing your need for support as a deficit, consider it a signal that you need a different kind of support—one that focuses on *your* needs. Please, reach out to a crisis line or doctor right now to talk about these overwhelming thoughts.",
